OL,3,GNEWSAPolice yet to receive #2m after
OL,4,AA66 crash, says commissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has still not received
OL,7,Fthe #2m it was promised by the
OL,8,Fgovernment in the wake of a car crash
OL,9,Fthat led to the deaths of seven people,
OL,10,Fincluding two police officers, the
OL,11,Flocal police and crime commissioner
OL,12,F(PCC) says.
OL,14,FCleveland PCC Matt Storey said
OL,15,FCleveland Police was still waiting for
OL,16,Fthe extra funding promised by the home
OL,17,Fsecretary in August.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
