OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice yet to receive #2m after
OL,4,AA66 crash, says commissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FShabana Mahmood pledged the cash in
OL,7,Flight of challenges faced by the force
OL,8,Ffollowing the deaths, which followed a
OL,9,Fpursuit on the A66 at South Bank, near
OL,10,FMiddlesbrough, on 22 August. Five young
OL,11,Fmen were also killed.
OL,13,FThe Home Office said it was working
OL,14,Fclosely with the force on the payment
OL,15,Fof the #2m and to ensure it had the
OL,16,Fsupport it needed.
